<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS - MAY 19/20.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS - MAY 19/20.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>19/20. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 19/20	 May 16-19</p>
<p> CZK	0.44344	   0.44041</p>
<p> DKK	2.10033	   2.10122</p>
<p> FIM	2.65424	   2.64827</p>
<p> HUF	0.07496	   0.07503</p>
<p> JPY	0.1168	    0.11738</p>
<p> LTL	3.3881	    3.39905</p>
<p> LVL     23.8284	   23.89733</p>
<p> RUR	0.00235	   0.00236</p>
<p> SEK	1.77862	   1.78655</p>
<p> UAH	7.34747	   7.32568</p>
<p> USD     13.5524	   13.5928</p>
<p> XEU     15.6144	   15.61473</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
